OL,3,GNEWSAPolice vow to 'do even more' as
OL,4,Aroad injuries rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police has vowed to do "even more"
OL,7,Fto tackle the rising number of deaths
OL,8,Fand serious injuries on the county's
OL,9,Froads.
OL,11,FNew figures prepared for a meeting with
OL,12,FKent Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,13,FMatthew Scott showed in the year to
OL,14,FSeptember, the number of people killed
OL,15,For seriously injured in crashes
OL,16,Fincreased from 44 to 74.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
