OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice vow to 'do even more' as
OL,4,Aroad injuries rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the number of fatalities remained
OL,7,Fat about 45 annually in recent years,
OL,8,Fbroadly in line with the national
OL,9,Faverage, the number of crashes
OL,10,Fincreased from 747 in 2020 to 960 in
OL,11,F2025.
OL,13,FKent Police Chief Constable Tim Smith
OL,14,Ftold Scott the force, together with
OL,15,Fpartners, was "going to have to do even
OL,16,Fmore in the future to reduce this".
